{
    "title": "Need for Speed\u2122 No Limits",
    "description": "Rule the street racing Underground as you race in the first Need for Speed made just for mobile! Conquer the asphalt of Blackridge city, engage your nitro, and tune your cars \u2014 from the game developer that brought you Real Racing 3! \r\n\r\nBuild the car collection of your dreams by acquiring cars, tuning them, and customizing them to your style. Launch yourself between chaos and control as you drift and roll into underground street racing. \r\n\r\nTake down the competition, engage your nitro, up your street rep, and burst into traffic - more races, customizations, and cars! Leave your mark on the city and never look back in this exciting racing game.\r\n\r\nNote: This app offers in-app purchases. You may disable in-app purchases using your device settings.\r\n\r\nA RACING GAME WITH NO LIMITS\r\n\r\nBecome a master car builder with the customization system, giving you over 2.5 million tuning combos to play with. Your rides are waiting \u2013 test them on the asphalt of the city\u2019s street racing scene.\r\n\r\nLevel-up your driving game with the real-world dream cars you\u2019ve always wanted - from manufacturers such as Bugatti, Lamborghini, McLaren, and many more top car brands. \r\n\r\nDRIVE FAST \u2014 AND FEARLESS\r\n\r\nSteer onto the asphalt of the Blackridge street racing scene, zip around debris, into traffic, against walls, and through high-speed Nitro Zones!\r\n\r\nAround every corner is a fresh racing rival \u2014 clash with local crews and evade cops. Get your driving game face on and earn unparalleled respect.\r\n\r\nRACE TO WIN\r\n\r\nNever back down as you take on extreme street racing, and never stop hitting nitro against anyone crazy enough to take you on. Increase your rep by any means necessary!\r\n\r\nDrift, drag, and roll your ride to the finish line while outrunning the police on your tail. Heat up the asphalt in over 1,000 challenging races in the infamous street racing city. Invest further into car tuning, be notorious, don\u2019t save your nitro \u2014 and change the racing game forever!\r\n\r\n---------------------\r\nUser Agreement: terms.ea.com\r\nVisit https://help.ea.com/ for assistance or inquiries.\r\n\r\nEA may retire online features and services after 30 days\u2019 notice posted on www.ea.com/1/service-updates\r\n\r\nImportant Consumer Information:\r\n\r\nThis app: requires a persistent Internet connection (network fees may apply); Requires acceptance of EA\u2019s Privacy & Cookie Policy and User Agreement. includes in-game advertising; collects data through third party analytics technology (see Privacy & Cookie Policy for details); contains direct links to the Internet and social networking sites intended for an audience over 13.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Rule the street racing Underground as you race in the first Need for Speed made just for mobile! Conquer the asphalt of Blackridge city, engage your nitro, and tune your cars \u2014 from the game developer that brought you Real Racing 3! <br><br>Build the car collection of your dreams by acquiring cars, tuning them, and customizing them to your style. Launch yourself between chaos and control as you drift and roll into underground street racing. <br><br>Take down the competition, engage your nitro, up your street rep, and burst into traffic - more races, customizations, and cars! Leave your mark on the city and never look back in this exciting racing game.<br><br>Note: This app offers in-app purchases. You may disable in-app purchases using your device settings.<br><br>A RACING GAME WITH NO LIMITS<br><br>Become a master car builder with the customization system, giving you over 2.5 million tuning combos to play with. Your rides are waiting \u2013 test them on the asphalt of the city\u2019s street racing scene.<br><br>Level-up your driving game with the real-world dream cars you\u2019ve always wanted - from manufacturers such as Bugatti, Lamborghini, McLaren, and many more top car brands. <br><br>DRIVE FAST \u2014 AND FEARLESS<br><br>Steer onto the asphalt of the Blackridge street racing scene, zip around debris, into traffic, against walls, and through high-speed Nitro Zones!<br><br>Around every corner is a fresh racing rival \u2014 clash with local crews and evade cops. Get your driving game face on and earn unparalleled respect.<br><br>RACE TO WIN<br><br>Never back down as you take on extreme street racing, and never stop hitting nitro against anyone crazy enough to take you on. Increase your rep by any means necessary!<br><br>Drift, drag, and roll your ride to the finish line while outrunning the police on your tail. Heat up the asphalt in over 1,000 challenging races in the infamous street racing city. Invest further into car tuning, be notorious, don\u2019t save your nitro \u2014 and change the racing game forever!<br><br>---------------------<br>User Agreement: terms.ea.com<br>Visit https://help.ea.com/ for assistance or inquiries.<br><br>EA may retire online features and services after 30 days\u2019 notice posted on www.ea.com/1/service-updates<br><br>Important Consumer Information:<br><br>This app: requires a persistent Internet connection (network fees may apply); Requires acceptance of EA\u2019s Privacy &amp; Cookie Policy and User Agreement. includes in-game advertising; collects data through third party analytics technology (see Privacy &amp; Cookie Policy for details); contains direct links to the Internet and social networking sites intended for an audience over 13.",
